---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Privacy — Matt Riley"
  description="The short version of how matt-riley.dev handles privacy."
>
  <main class="legal-page">
    <a class="legal-page__back" href="/">← Back to matt-riley.dev</a>
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal note / 01</p>
    <h1>Privacy, without the fog.</h1>
    <p class="legal-page__lead">This site is a static personal site. It does not ask for your name, email, or anything else.</p>
    <div class="legal-page__body">
      <h2>What is stored</h2>
      <p>The day or night edition choice is stored in your browser's local storage so the page remembers how you left it.</p>
      <h2>What is not collected</h2>
      <p>There is no analytics tracker, account system, contact form, or server side visitor profile on this site.</p>
      <h2>External links</h2>
      <p>Links to GitHub, mattriley.work, and mattriley.tools leave this site and have their own policies.</p>
      <p class="legal-page__updated">Last updated: 27 August 2026</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>
